WqnNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGdtiGAZsdUil5mA3Lb6KUyFlJzB0NL9cZE_vPZf3dQZQ&oe=6A845D0F"}, {"file_name": "Gamestill_2_1.png", "id": "730993767596206", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75292490_730993774262872_7203892228344656958_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ov0klfy-v2IQ7kNvwFNwhST&_nc_oc=AdpEH0TWd5Mk-8ZuTZPWuUv4-P2Fy7K0pyHQqcr_lBIceV0wHOaFeYbuSW7WD1TQeOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG9xADLKo7rdZEt2YQCsQaMdYrs55vcqQkEx09x_0MtwA&oe=6A84327D"}, {"file_name": "Gamestill_2_3.png", "id": "2939976282883307", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036632_2939976286216640_5800461904326178318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ogokZfxgosIQ7kNvwGAbruY&_nc_oc=AdpV_W3rOteA6coffi2CAcS483qshS34LPaAd033ncE7zdg-wM_Y4q9PTljQAvptTTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-fYga23hd--poZrLC0yEIHizfXX4klAuE2zR03Bb0tQ&oe=6A846515"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Painting VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Painting in virtual reality is easy as one two three: mix your colors, dip your brush in and start painting. \n\nThe experience is very hands-on, easy to understand, and aimed at all ages. Play around and feel the relaxing satisfaction of putting unlimited amounts of fresh paint on a huge canvas. Teach yourself the basics of colors, the painting process and composition. Sharpen your skills by experimenting with the tools and techniques at hand, and become part of a new wave of digital artists. All without having to bother about cleaning up afterward. \n", "short_description": "Painting VR is a virtual reality art painting simulation game with gigantic canvases, satisfying brushes, and an unlimited supply of paint. "}]}, "developer_name": "Oisoi.studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://paintingvr.xyz/privacy-policy-web-1", "developer_terms_